{
  "_comment": "⛔ QUARANTINED scene styles (five-line split, Aaron 2026-08-12): this dormant bench's style blocks, vendored OUT of ui_theme.json (a scene's values belong in its scene file). They move into this bench's own .scene.json at its migration — do not grow this file. Colors are $token refs into ui_theme.json's theme.tokens; a `theme` key here is refused as a palette fork.",
  "loomforge": {
    "_comment": "Loomforge Bench (crates/flicker-loomforge) — the animation-authoring editor: State Machine · Pack Browser · Creature Composer · TAE Editor. The chrome (top bar / tab bar / body) is a Rust UiNode tree run through the flicker-widgets walker; the node-graph canvas and TAE timeline are drawn by the scene itself. Every colour is a $token ref into theme.tokens — the one Prism palette.",
    "top_bar": {
      "fill_top": "$stone2",
      "fill_bot": "$stone1",
      "border": "$edge2",
      "border_w": 1,
      "radius": 0
    },
    "title": {
      "color": "$ink_bright"
    },
    "badge": {
      "color": "$bronze"
    },
    "tab_bar": {
      "fill_top": "$stone1",
      "fill_bot": "$stone0",
      "border": "$edge1",
      "border_w": 1,
      "radius": 0
    },
    "tab_active": {
      "fill_top": "$sap_base",
      "fill_bot": "$sap_base_lo",
      "hover_top": "$sap_hover",
      "hover_bot": "$sap_hover_lo",
      "border": "$sap_border",
      "hover_border": "$sap_hover_border",
      "label": "$ink_bright",
      "radius": 3
    },
    "tab_idle": {
      "fill_top": "$stone3",
      "fill_bot": "$stone2",
      "hover_top": "$stone_btn_hi",
      "hover_bot": "$stone_btn",
      "border": "$edge2",
      "hover_border": "$edge3",
      "label": "$dim",
      "radius": 3
    },
    "button_primary": {
      "fill_top": "$sap_base",
      "fill_bot": "$sap_base_lo",
      "hover_top": "$sap_hover",
      "hover_bot": "$sap_hover_lo",
      "border": "$sap_border",
      "hover_border": "$sap_hover_border",
      "label": "$ink_bright",
      "radius": 3
    },
    "button_secondary": {
      "fill_top": "$stone_btn_hi",
      "fill_bot": "$stone_btn",
      "hover_top": "$stone3",
      "hover_bot": "$stone2",
      "border": "$edge3",
      "hover_border": "$edge4",
      "label": "$ink_label",
      "radius": 3
    },
    "body": {
      "fill_top": "$stone0",
      "fill_bot": "$stone0",
      "border": "$edge1",
      "border_w": 0,
      "radius": 0
    },
    "body_text": {
      "color": "$ink"
    },
    "_canvas_comment": "The node-graph canvas is drawn by the SCENE (not the widgets walker), so it reads these colours by dotted path rather than as a node style.",
    "canvas": {
      "bg": "$stone0",
      "grid": "$hairline",
      "card_fill_top": "$stone3",
      "card_fill_bot": "$stone2",
      "card_border": "$edge2",
      "card_border_sel": "$sap_border",
      "card_label": "$ink_bright",
      "card_label_sel": "$ink_sapphire",
      "card_meta": "$dim",
      "stage_top": "$stone3",
      "stage_bot": "$stone0",
      "stage_border": "$edge1",
      "edge": "$bronze",
      "edge_sel": "$rune_glow",
      "drop_hint": "$sap_glow"
    },
    "rail": {
      "fill_top": "$stone2",
      "fill_bot": "$stone1",
      "border": "$edge2",
      "border_w": 1,
      "radius": 0
    },
    "rail_title": {
      "color": "$bronze"
    },
    "rail_text": {
      "color": "$ink"
    },
    "clip_row": {
      "fill_top": "$stone3",
      "fill_bot": "$stone2",
      "hover_top": "$stone_btn_hi",
      "hover_bot": "$stone_btn",
      "border": "$edge2",
      "hover_border": "$sap_border",
      "label": "$ink",
      "radius": 3
    },
    "_stage_comment": "Backdrop panels for `stage` nodes. The doll composites INTO the rect these frame; `inset` is how far the image sits inside the border. What each stage RENDERS lives in the shared top-level `stages` block, named by the node's `source` prop.",
    "clip_stage": {
      "fill_top": "$stone3",
      "fill_bot": "$stone0",
      "border": "$edge1",
      "border_w": 1,
      "radius": 3,
      "inset": 1
    },
    "_pack_kind_comment": "Pack Browser accent per pack KIND. The kind is DERIVED by reading what a pack contains (combat windows -> Weapon, events -> Ability, multi-state and eventless -> Locomotion), never authored into the file — there is no gameplay runtime behind a pack category yet, so no pack claims one. Hexes are the DC's: #9db8ff / #c8707a / #e0b23a / #8f8a7d, each an EXACT existing token.",
    "pack_kind": {
      "locomotion": {
        "color": "$rune_glow_hi"
      },
      "weapon": {
        "color": "$danger_hi"
      },
      "ability": {
        "color": "$sig_yellow"
      },
      "creature": {
        "color": "$dim"
      }
    },
    "tae": {
      "fill_top": "$stone1",
      "fill_bot": "$stone0",
      "border": "$bronze_dim",
      "border_w": 1,
      "radius": 0
    },
    "_tae_lane_comment": "The nine TAE event lanes, keyed by lane id — their ORDER lives in Rust (tae::Lane::ALL), because order is spec, not colour. Per lane: `swatch` tints the gutter label, `row`/`row_border` are the track's own fill and edge, `event` fills a window bar. A one-shot (an event with no `end` tick) draws as a narrow marker in the same colour, so point-vs-span comes from the DATA rather than from which lane it lands on.",
    "tae_lane": {
      "track": "$well",
      "track_border": "$edge1",
      "ruler": "$dim",
      "playhead": "$rune_glow",
      "event_sel": "$rune_glow",
      "budget_ok": "$sig_green",
      "budget_tight": "$sig_yellow",
      "budget_over": "$danger_hi",
      "hitbox": {
        "swatch": "$danger_hi",
        "row": "$danger_bg_lo",
        "row_border": "$danger_border",
        "event": "$danger_hi"
      },
      "iframe": {
        "swatch": "$rune_glow",
        "row": "$stone2",
        "row_border": "$edge2",
        "event": "$mana_hi"
      },
      "parry": {
        "swatch": "$sig_white",
        "row": "$stone2",
        "row_border": "$edge2",
        "event": "$sig_white"
      },
      "cancel": {
        "swatch": "$bronze",
        "row": "$stone2",
        "row_border": "$edge2",
        "event": "$bronze_deep"
      },
      "hyperarmor": {
        "swatch": "$stam_hi",
        "row": "$stone2",
        "row_border": "$edge2",
        "event": "$stam_lo"
      },
      "telegraph": {
        "swatch": "$sig_orange",
        "row": "$stone2",
        "row_border": "$edge2",
        "event": "$sig_orange"
      },
      "sfx": {
        "swatch": "$dim",
        "row": "$stone2",
        "row_border": "$edge2",
        "event": "$dim"
      },
      "vfx": {
        "swatch": "$dim",
        "row": "$stone2",
        "row_border": "$edge2",
        "event": "$rune_halo"
      },
      "notify": {
        "swatch": "$dim",
        "row": "$stone2",
        "row_border": "$edge2",
        "event": "$dim"
      }
    }
  }
}
